{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","盖亚能量炮"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","首次释放终极技能时，亚古兽进化为战斗暴龙兽；后续释放终极技能时，战斗暴龙兽发射“盖亚能量炮”对大范围的敌人造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗中，亚古兽使用“小型火焰”作为普通攻击，对敌人造成150% ATK伤害。首次释放终极技能，亚古兽会进化为战斗暴龙兽，永久提升100%的生命值和50%的攻击力，并解锁其他技能。战斗暴龙兽释放终极技能时，向当前目标发射凝聚了大量能量的“盖亚能量炮”，对目标区域3格范围的敌人造成7段160% + 20% ATK攻击力的伤害，对处于范围中心的敌人造成的伤害提升至220% + 30% ATK，释放期间自身处于霸体状态。被动地，太一始终在场外处于无敌状态，并与自己的搭档并肩作战。每隔3秒，太一会鼓舞搭档，使其回复150点能量。亚古兽尚未进化为战斗暴龙兽时，每次通过这种方式回复的能量额外提升250点。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":146,"end":152,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":185,"end":191,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":36,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":142,"end":156,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":181,"end":195,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":204,"end":206,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":222,"end":224,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至190% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“盖亚能量炮”每段造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK，对处于范围中心的敌人的伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":52,"end":58,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","战斗龙卷风"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","贯穿所有敌人，对途径的每个敌人造成伤害并眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","高速旋转，依次贯穿所有敌人后回到原地，对途经的每个敌人造成420% + 40% ATK的伤害，并使其眩晕2秒，技能释放期间战斗暴龙兽处于无敌状态。本技能造成的伤害附带额外60点防御穿透。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":68,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对途经的每个敌人造成的伤害提升至440% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对途经的每个敌人造成的伤害提升至460% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对途经的每个敌人造成的伤害提升至480% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","勇气之护"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得护盾，期间霸体，并在持续时间结束后基于护盾剩余值回复生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使自身获得700% + 100% ATK的护盾，持续10秒。护盾持续期间，战斗暴龙兽处于霸体状态。护盾持续时间结束后，战斗暴龙兽回复等同于该护盾剩余值150% + 10%的生命值。当亚古兽进化为战斗暴龙兽时，会立即获得1次勇气护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":44,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾提升至800% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾提升至900% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","获得的护盾提升至1000% + 100% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升攻击力，参与击败一名敌方非召唤物角色后，额外提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升9%攻击力。参与击败一名敌方非召唤物角色后，额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升12%攻击力。参与击败一名敌方非召唤物角色后，额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，提升15%攻击力。参与击败一名敌方非召唤物角色后，额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","龙兽克星"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成多次生命流失，当场上只剩下最后一名敌人且其生命值低于一定比例时会将其立刻击败。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成3次斩击，每次使其流失140% ATK的生命值。在场上只剩下最后1名敌人且这名敌人生命值低于自身650% ATK时，本技能转而变为穿透到敌人身后并将其立刻击败。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":53,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命流失提升至160% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗暴龙兽的普通攻击和技能对敌人造成伤害时，会额外附带基于敌人已损失生命值15%的伤害，该额外伤害至多不超过战斗暴龙兽180% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":59,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","生命流失提升至180% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，使身后的友军提升攻击力。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，将勇气的力量分享给友军，使自身和所有更靠后的友军提升等同于自身25%的攻击力，持续20秒。分享勇气给加布兽时，使其额外获得300点能量。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","勇气徽章"]]}